{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "JON",
  "chapter": 2,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JON.2.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JON.2.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then Jonah prayed to the LORD his God out of the fish's belly,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JON.2.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JON.2.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And said, I cried by reason of my affliction to the LORD, and he heard me; out of the belly of hell cried I, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thou heardst my voice.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JON.2.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JON.2.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thou hadst cast me into the deep, in the midst of the seas; and the floods encompassed me: all thy billows and thy waves passed over me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JON.2.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JON.2.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then I said, I am cast out of thy sight; yet I will look again towards thy holy temple.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JON.2.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JON.2.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The waters encompassed me, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to the soul: the depth inclosed me on every side, the weeds were wrapped about my head.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JON.2.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JON.2.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I went down to the bottoms of the mountains; the earth with her bars ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " about me for ever: yet hast thou brought up my life from corruption, O LORD my God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JON.2.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JON.2.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When my soul fainted within me I remembered the LORD: and my prayer came to thee, into thy holy temple.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JON.2.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JON.2.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They that observe lying vanities forsake their own mercy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JON.2.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JON.2.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I will sacrifice to thee with the voice of thanksgiving; I will pay ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " which I have vowed. Salvation ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JON.2.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JON.2.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the LORD spoke to the fish, and it vomited out Jonah upon the dry ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "land",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
